    "rating": 4.8,
    "reference": "ChIJa7-8_v83yUwRi4faWcKDawA",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Amal Kassim",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105987858285691536101/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLWbyx0lqyfxGzZN7Ozn_CRwUCRTq6JCqzXzofD_OG6pERTFw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "If I could give 0 stars, I would. I visited this store from Toronto specifically to purchase olive oil bottles my father had requested. While browsing, I took one quick photo to show him the different bottle sizes and options available. To my shock, a female employee interrupted a transaction she was having with other customers to confront me about why I was taking photos. She caused an unnecessary scene and drew attention from the entire store.\n\nI explained I was sending the photo to my father to confirm what he needed, but her reaction was completely uncalled for. Given the context and the fact that I am a visibly Muslim woman wearing a hijab, I can't help but feel that her behavior was rooted in racial profiling. It was an upsetting and disappointing experience will not return.\n\nWe actually intended to purchase multiple bottles of olive oil but her attitude ruined the sale.",
        "time": 1750807026,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shalini Dowlani-Bharwani",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102486767794058616893/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKoIiFrYA2caI5eiwLIvgvn8rBY0XCPcFZRATtgsjsBxUU6PQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Denise (in the Vaudreuil-Dorion store) helped me with my choices and boy does she know her stuff about the pairings of balsamic and olive oil, and everything else in the store!!\nShe’s so kind and extremely knowledgeable about all the products.   There are many different flavors, very creative ones too, all which sound divine.   I got a 101 course on the oils and balsamic pairings with tastings which really helped me decide which ones to buy.  Denise is a superstar.  You would be lucky to have her expertise!!   I will be back for sure!!",
        "time": 1752808248,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rathu Siva",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111741612082570837764/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWMDKReYi36K9s13cs0mubrgItJJllJ-l938Tod4mdO4WBYcs9d=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "They have many flavors that will enhance everyday life. I loved the customer service. You can buy in bulk with your own bottle or reuse theirs (just make sure it's washed and dried properly). They also sell other gourmet products that look and taste delicious! Look forward to trying new things here :>)",
        "time": 1722028279,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Emily Guillemette-Dargis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104134346615368181381/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUbMcpEDbcwyCJM-eJgsJ4Bu-fhifuTEaxv1yNPhtRMvOd5y4568A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "The products are of great quality, many different choices. The customer service is amazing, it's 100% worth a visit. Also you can sample before buying and they always give you great ideas. My personal favorite is Basil Olive Oil and Garlic Balsamic, which creates a beautiful combo put together.",
        "time": 1558379377,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nicolas Brunet",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105627902465000252511/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVb2JXew5TN90VNxZOGuu4G-zfIm4hKIsdNaSolYLUhkVWih2wM0A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Wonderful place that made an outstanding wrapping for gifts. Instead of a bottle of wine when being invited somewhere a beautiful bottle of high quality olive oil and balsamic will steal the show. :) Thank you for a wonderful experience every time!",
        "time": 1596138748,
        "translated": false
      }
